From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:31:00 +0800
Subject: session-ui/message: edit button and version switcher
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The revert button on user messages is now "Edit message" (pencil); nothing is lost by using
it, since sending keeps the old messages as a branch (patch core/message-branches). A message
that starts a branch shows "‹ 2/3 ›"; the arrows switch the conversation in place. The
switcher stays visible; the other actions still wait for hover on desktop.

Ocelot-Patch: web/message-branches

